DIAGNOSTICS
     `Login incorrect', if the name or the password is bad, or if
     a group was specified and the user is not a member of the
     named group.
     `No shell', `cannot open password file', `no directory':
     consult a programming counselor.
     `Sorry. You cannot login at this time', if UNIX is running
     in special session.

BUGS
     Changes the login name of a user when invoked from a shell.
     Many systems do not allow its use in this way, for that rea-
     son.
     It is not possible to use a login name with an embedded `.'
     if the `name.group' syntax is allowed.

